| Feature | Lexical | Froala |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Bold, italic, underline | `dispatchCommand(FORMAT_TEXT_COMMAND, 'bold')` | The `bold`, `italic` and `underline` buttons, or `commands.bold()` |
| Headings | `HeadingNode` from `@lexical/rich-text` | The `paragraphFormat` button and option |
| Lists | `@lexical/list` | The `formatUL` and `formatOL` buttons |
| Links | `@lexical/link` | The `insertLink` button |
| Tables | `@lexical/table` | The `insertTable` button |
| Undo, redo | `HistoryPlugin` from `@lexical/history` | Built in, `commands.undo()` and `commands.redo()` |
| Markdown | `@lexical/markdown` | The Markdown plugin, `markdown.getMarkdown()` |
| HTML | `@lexical/html` | `html.get()`, `html.set()` |
| Read-only | `setEditable(false)` | `edit.off()` |
| Stored format | `editorState.toJSON()`, a node tree | An HTML string |

