| Task | Quill | Froala |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Create | `new Quill(selector, options)` | `new FroalaEditor(selector, options)` |
| Placeholder | `placeholder` | `placeholderText` |
| Toolbar | `modules.toolbar` | `toolbarButtons` |
| Inline toolbar | `theme: 'bubble'` | `toolbarInline: true` |
| Choose features | `modules` | `pluginsEnabled`, `pluginsDisabled` |
| Get HTML | `getSemanticHTML()` | `html.get()` |
| Set HTML | `clipboard.dangerouslyPasteHTML(html)` | `html.set(html)` |
| Insert HTML | `clipboard.dangerouslyPasteHTML(index, html)` | `html.insert(html)` |
| Plain text | `getText()` | `el.textContent` |
| Content event | `text-change` | `contentChanged` |
| Read-only | `disable()`, `enable()` | `edit.off()`, `edit.on()` |
| Focus | `focus()` | `events.focus()` |
| Tear down | No method | `destroy()` |
| Image upload | A toolbar handler you write | `imageUploadURL` |
| React | `react-quill-new`, community | `react-froala-wysiwyg`, by Froala |

