Returns a `Map<Object, Object>`.

Method used to upload file to the specified location on disk.

### **Parameters**

| Parameter | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `request` | `HttpServletRequest` | All the HTTP specific information for the HTTP request. |
| `fileRoute` | `String` | The server route for file uploads. This route must be public. End it with a slash, such as `/public/`, because the SDK adds the file name right after it. |
| `options` | `FileOptions` | This parameter is optional. It is used to pass custom options for the file upload. |

Short example of `options`.

