# Word Counter in Froala Editor

## Word Counter

Using the `word_counter.min.js`plugin it is possible to [limit the number of words](https://froala.com/word-counter-demo/) that can be introduced into the WYSIWYG HTML editor.

The maximum number of words can be changed using the [wordCounterMax](https://froala.com/wysiwyg-editor/docs/options#wordCounterMax "charCounterMax option") option.

